": "1484706003505018", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825470_1484706010171684_4876386001050931614_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vv3uP11nCeQQ7kNvwH6HV2a&_nc_oc=AdrMq_-6lrsN89z39ZqIgwdZa-w6oLvQU7g6_x5NPO42SElQv9GFtH6qgALjrM6GM4A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRiEKe8o_K3bm52JPMkMh80ZeoiyV8Uz5Jw63kZfr6Rhw&oe=6AF47C9F"}, "display_name": "RC Brains: Moon Update", "keywords": ["racing", "socialvr", "rccars", "vehicles", "mechs"], "long_description": "# \ud83c\udf19 THE MOON UPDATE IS HERE \ud83c\udf19\n\nRC Brains is a chaotic Social VR playground where you play as a Brain, jump into RC vehicles, and race, fly, crash, explore, and hang out with friends.\n\n**Join the Community=>** https://discord.gg/rcbrains\n \n\n \n# DRIVE RC CARS IN VR\n{3874153959558303}\n\n# PILOT GIANT MECHS\n{28354157054211153}\n\n\nEnter BrainTech City, suit up in a giant mech, and move with your own arms.\n\nClimb, launch, grapple, swing between buildings, and master the city with friends.\n\n# FLY RC DRONES & PLANES IN VR\n{3744554712353768}\n{2225960998146844}\n\n# PILOT GIANT MECHS\n{28354157054211153}\n\n\nEnter BrainTech City, suit up in a giant mech, and move with your own arms.\n\nClimb, launch, grapple, swing between buildings, and master the city with friends.\n\n\n# BECOME THE BRAIN\n{4300031590325704}\n\nJump into RC vehicles, hang out with friends, and create funny moments across the playground.\n\nRace, fly, crash, earn rewards, and become the Brain everyone remembers.\n\n{1526593175742234}\n\n", "short_description": "Play as a Brain in a chaotic Social VR playground! Jump into RC cars, fly RC planes, hang out with friends, earn Brain Bits, and build your RESPECT!"}]}, "developer_name": "AshRift Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/rcbrains-privacypolicy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "IRONHEAD", "support_website_url": null, "webs